-- thalidomide's two forms and the inversion between them, at its measured half-life in human serum:
-- 22 minutes from the (S) form, 33 from the (R) (pH 7.4, 37 °C). Hand stands for the two
-- configurations at the one stereocentre.
td-inv : Interconv Hand
td-inv a b = case a of
  hand-l → (case b of hand-l → 0; hand-r → 22)
  hand-r → (case b of hand-l → 33; hand-r → 0)
